WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.600
Episode 25

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.600
Iscandar, the Dying Planet of Love<i>!!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.600
( Air date: Mar 23, 1975 )

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:22.230
Goodbye, Earth.{Saraba chikyuu yo}

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:27.100
A ship is taking off...{Tabidatsu fune wa}

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:36.240
...it's the space battleship Yamato.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.250
Space Battleship

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.250
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:44.580
It's about to take off to Iscandar...

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:49.150
...carrying the fate of humanity.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:55.980
We'll return for sure.{Kanarazu koko he kaette kuru to}

00:00:55.980 --> 00:01:04.450
Smile back at the people waving their hands.{te wo furu hito ni egao de kotae}

00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:10.800
Leaving the Galactic System and
taking a long journey to Iscandar.{Ginga wo hanare Iscandar he harubaru nozomu}

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:16.430
Space battleship Yamato!{Ucyuu senkan yamato}

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:58.790
Altitude 500 km. Entering satellite
orbit to calculate landing coordinates.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:01.170
Ohta, resume analysis.

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:04.500
Planet Iscandar has continents
and oceans similar to Earth's.

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:07.750
I got it.  The guidance beacon
from Starsha has restarted.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.390
Aihara, put it on
the main speaker.

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:11.110
Yes, sir.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:15.050
I'm Starsha of Iscandar.

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:17.730
I welcome the
crew of the Yamato.

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:22.720
Please land in the
ocean near the Mother Town.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:27.740
I'll guide you through, so set your
controls according to the guide beacon.

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:32.190
Current pressure on the surface
is 980 millibars, temperature...

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:41.070
In 2199, Earth was attacked by
Gamilus, an invader from space...

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:45.750
{juuman}...and mankind was faced with extinction in
one year due to the radioactive poison.

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:50.040
{sonokoro}Planet Iscandar, located
148,000 light-years away...

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.240
{sonokoro}...sent a message to Earth about giving them a radioactive contamination purifier.

00:02:53.240 --> 00:02:56.660
{sono}The space battleship Yamato is
the ambassador sent to receive it.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.290
{yamato}The Yamato overcame many
supernatural phenomena...

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:02.950
{yamato}...and also defeated
its arch enemy, Gamilus.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.540
{ima}Now they have finally
arrived at Planet Iscandar.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:50.860
Hey Kodai,
look over there.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:58.920
It's Starsha.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:07.490
She looks like Yuki.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:25.520
Welcome to Iscandar.
I'm Starsha.

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.640
I'm Susumu Kodai.
She's...

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.400
Sarsia...

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:34.620
If you were on the Yamato,
why didn't you tell me ?

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.290
No, I'm...

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.490
Sarsia ?

00:04:37.490 --> 00:04:40.450
So the woman who
died on Mars was...

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:43.640
What ?
Sarsia died ?

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:44.550
Then you are...

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.750
I'm a woman from Earth.
My name is Mori Yuki.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:58.180
Please tell me what happened
to my sister Sarsia on Mars.

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:02.290
Her shuttle was shot down by Gamilus
and it crash-landed on Mars.

00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:05.040
Shima here, and myself,
found her first...

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:10.340
...but unfortunately, it was
after she had already passed away.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:15.940
But we were able to
retrieve your message...

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:19.250
...and discovered how to
construct the Wave Motion Engine.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:26.850
So, she sacrificed herself
to fulfill her responsibility.

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:28.810
Earth owes her
a great debt.

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:33.510
But it's still you
who will save the Earth.

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:39.730
I apologize for testing your determination and
strength by asking you to come all this way.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:44.950
However, only you can open
the way to your own future.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:12.150
So that's the purifier that will get rid
of the radioactive contamination on Earth.

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:17.040
It's not built, but we've received
parts and the schematics...

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:21.310
{WATASHI}...and I'll finish it in the onboard factory
before the Yamato returns to Earth.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:23.050
I'm counting on you.

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:29.090
I wish I could build it here, and ask
the engineers of Iscandar to test it...

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:32.740
{JIKAN}...but we don't have time, because
we're 2 months behind schedule.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:36.660
{KYUU}We were supposed to return in the 9th month,
but it's going to be the 11th at this rate.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:40.450
That's serious. One mistake
will lead to a disaster.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:44.230
Mankind could be extinct
by the time we get home.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:45.310
That's absurd.

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:51.520
That could happen, so we have to do
our best. That's all we can do now.

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:05.800
Incredible. This is Utopia
at the height of technology.

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:19.270
Look to the left. That island
is entirely made of diamond.

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:39.370
Thank you for attending
her funeral, Kodai, Yuki.

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:45.090
Now she has returned
to the soil of Iscandar.

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:46.900
Ummm, Starsha...?

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.470
What is it ?

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:53.070
We've looked around many places,
but I haven't seen anyone except you.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:58.520
Where are the rest
of your people ?

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.690
Here.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:06.150
You mean all the people
of Iscandar are dead ?

00:08:06.150 --> 00:08:12.590
Yes. My sister and I are from the
royal family, and we were the last.

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:18.790
Now that Sarsia is gone,
I'm the last one.

00:08:21.070 --> 00:08:24.390
How terrible.
How did that happen ?

00:08:24.390 --> 00:08:25.440
It was our fate.

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:31.230
Everything has its
own fated lifespan.

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:35.840
{KONO}This planet, Iscandar, and
planet Gamilus are twins...

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:41.340
{KONO}...both of which are
reaching their final moments.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:48.060
{SOKODE}Gamilus tried to conquer Earth, but they
ended up destroying themselves in the end.

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:54.000
{WATASHI}We, the people of Iscandar, didn't want
to bother the people of other planets...

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:56.180
...and quietly
accepted our fate.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:05.040
Let's go inside the Town.

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.180
I want you
to meet someone.

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.360
Is there somone
besides you ?

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.740
A person from Earth.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:15.840
A person from Earth ?

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.800
Please take him back
to Earth on the Yamato.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.330
Is that you, Susumu...?

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:09.720
Brother !

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.210
Susumu !

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:13.590
You're alive, Brother !

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:14.590
Brother !

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.490
Starsha...

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.450
Sorry for coming
in without asking.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.830
It's alright.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:43.740
He's Kodai Mamoru.

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:46.820
It seems that he was
taken captive as a specimen.

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:53.800
{TOKOROGA}But the ship transporting him was damaged
and drifted near Iscandar, so I saved him.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:57.590
{SORE}He had severe injuries
and was very ill...

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.420
{SORE}...but he's alright now,
and he can go home.

00:11:03.130 --> 00:11:04.630
Starsha...

00:11:05.810 --> 00:11:09.500
You love Kodai Mamoru, don't you ?

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:40.900
By the way, is it true that we won't make
it even if we bring the purifier home ?

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:45.630
No, that's a possibility.
It's not for sure.

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:49.180
But that could
happen, right ?

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.730
Pops...

00:11:58.950 --> 00:12:06.310
{JINRUI}...suppose mankind is extinct,
and we are the only survivors...

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:08.750
{YAPPARI}...don't you think we should
chose this planet to live on ?

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:11.300
Yabu, what's on your mind ?

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:27.700
So that's the Yamato.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.730
Captain, Kodai Mamoru reporting.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:12:59.570
Captain...

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:03.660
Kodai, I'm glad you're alive.

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:06.590
Kodai Mamoru is alive !

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:08.880
Oh, Captain, pardon me.

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:12.040
I don't mind.
You guys are classmates.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:12.940
You must be happy.

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:14.060
Sanada.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:17.100
Kodai, you bastard !
You aren't a ghost, are you ?

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.590
You haven't changed at all.

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:20.800
This's great.

00:13:26.520 --> 00:13:29.470
Oh, did you call me ?
What do you mean by important ?

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:32.830
Sorry to bother you, but I have something
I want to discuss. Please, come with me.

00:13:33.760 --> 00:13:36.570
Okay. Let go of me.
You're hurting me.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:40.810
I was unconscious
until a few days ago.

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:43.100
I owe Starsha
for saving me.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:46.900
What incredible medical technology,
to revive a near dead person.

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:47.940
Indeed.

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:51.070
Now, go ahead.
Go ahead.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.700
This is great.
Here you go.

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.040
Brother...

00:13:57.040 --> 00:14:00.300
...why don't we ask Starsha
to come to Earth with us ?

00:14:10.940 --> 00:14:12.770
Why not, Starsha ?

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:15.600
You'd be able to live
happily, if you do so.

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:19.640
Even if the
planet is dying...

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:25.070
...there are still several thousand
years until Iscandar is totally ruined.

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.920
I cannot abandon it.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.220
Besides...

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:31.090
Besides ?

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:34.690
There are people I cannot
get along with on Earth.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.110
Come with me.

00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:43.740
What're they doing ?

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:46.450
It seems like some people
want to stay on this planet.

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:53.130
It's the White Castle on Diamond Island.
They look as if they are going to seize it.

00:14:53.440 --> 00:14:55.590
How stupid.
I'll stop them immediately.

00:14:55.590 --> 00:15:01.450
Please do so. That island is supposed
to sink into the ocean tonight.

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:02.500
Say what ?

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:06.980
The seismograph has been recording
unusual tectonic movement in the mantle.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:11.350
The corruption of the crust on planet
Gamilus might be affecting this planet.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:17.770
I'll be back.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.800
Yabu and some others
have left the Yamato.

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:41.230
I apologize for
my poor supervision.

00:15:41.230 --> 00:15:44.150
Incoming message from Yabu.
I'm switching to the main speaker.

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:47.830
Kodai...Sub-Captain...
Is Kodai there ?

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:50.290
You idiot !
Come back !

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.350
I'm here.
This is Kodai.

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:56.270
The twelve of us request
permission to stay on this planet.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:59.380
How can I do that ?  Come back to the
ship, immediately. That's an order.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:02.450
I thought you'd say so, but
I have no intention of coming back.

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:08.170
Yabu, don't you care about Earth
and its people ?  Hey, Yabu !

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:11.290
We left, because we thought
about the future of mankind.

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:16.040
{oretachi}Even if the Yamato is involved in
an accident, or mankind is extinct...

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.640
{chikyuu} ...as long as we live here,
Earth won't lose its descendants.

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:19.450
{mochi}If the Yamato accomplishes its mission...

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:23.720
{mochi}...humans will live on both planets,
and that's even better.

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:28.940
Hey, are you crazy ?  How could you
create descendants without a woman ?

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:31.380
Don't worry.
We have a bride.

00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:32.370
Say what ?

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:33.800
Kodai...

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:34.850
Yuki !

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:37.940
Don't even think about
threatening us. That's all.

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:41.640
Damn, you took her as a
hostage. How dirty of you.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.080
This will end
our transmission.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.490
Wait, Yabu !

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:49.480
That place is dangerous. Diamond
Island will sink beneath the ocean tonight.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:54.450
Kodai, I thought you
were smarter than that.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:58.940
It's true. I'm not just saying that, Iscandar's
seismograph indicates it will happen.

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.390
Get out of there !
I'm begging you !

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:04.310
Come in !
Hey, Yabu, respond !

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:07.810
A tsunami is approaching !

00:17:14.330 --> 00:17:15.660
Shima, get us outta here.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.790
Chief Engine Operator
Tokugawa, please help.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.940
Kato, are you there ?

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.900
Get the choppers ready, and
prepare for a rescue operation.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:25.060
Activate the sub engines.
All hands, fasten seatbelts.

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:34.600
Take off preparations completed.
It's time to head back to Earth.

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:38.970
Remember, you have command.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:42.120
All hands, take your positions
and prepare for take off.

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:43.140
Aye, sir.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:51.070
I'm sorry for all the trouble.
But still, Yabu was my favorite subordinate.

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:53.220
Please, forgive him.

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:04.490
Starsha, are you sure you
don't want to come with us ?

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:09.300
I appreciate your offer,
but I can't leave Iscandar.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.520
I see.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:13.340
Well then,
please take care.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:23.810
Starsha...

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.400
Are you sure it's okay
to let Kodai Mamoru go home ?

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:35.620
You can't find love by
accepting an established fate.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:41.620
You told us that we should open
the way to the future ourselves.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.750
Goodbye, Starsha.

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:06.950
Mamoru...

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:18.260
I love you...Mamoru.

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:24.860
Starsha !

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:26.100
Brother !

00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:35.410
Susumu, forgive me.

00:22:01.390 --> 00:22:03.400
Brother, take care !

00:22:04.270 --> 00:22:05.660
Hang in there, Susumu !

00:22:08.810 --> 00:22:09.920
Goodbye !

00:22:28.030 --> 00:22:32.800
My brother and Starsha are
the Adam and Eve of Iscandar.

00:22:34.260 --> 00:22:36.280
Yuki, let's go home.

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:42.810
Let's head back to Earth !

00:22:58.190 --> 00:23:01.280
Now the Yamato is
heading back to Earth.

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:05.510
The journey of 148,000
light-years is long.

00:23:05.510 --> 00:23:06.970
Fly, Yamato.

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:10.590
The people on Earth
are waiting for you.

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:15.280
Mankind will be
extinct in 131 days.

00:23:15.500 --> 00:23:21.420
131 days left until the destruction of Earth

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:29.380
Okita Juzo:

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:29.380
Naya Goro

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:36.820
A girl was waving her red scarf.{Anoko ga futteita makka na scarf}

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:34.880
Mori Yuki:

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:34.880
Asagami Yoko

00:23:35.150 --> 00:23:40.390
Kodai Mamoru:

00:23:35.150 --> 00:23:40.390
Hirokawa Taichiro

00:23:36.820 --> 00:23:45.620
Who was that for ?{Dareno tame da to omotte iruka}

00:23:41.800 --> 00:23:51.300
Notes:
The Yamato arrives at Iscandar. From Sanada's dialogue, it should be the 220th day, and 18 days after the battle on Planet Gamilus.  The Yamato must have repaired the main turrets and rebuilt the third bridge.

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:53.920
It doesn't matter who it was for...{Dare no tame demo ii ja nai ka}

00:23:51.300 --> 00:24:01.300
Notes:
After the flashback of Sarsia, the background changes to night.

00:23:51.300 --> 00:24:01.300
When Kodai orders the Yamato to take off to avoid the tidal wave, the bridge cell is placed over Kodai, which was a simple photographing mistake.

00:23:53.920 --> 00:24:02.820
...everyone should take it as theirs.{Minna sono ki de ireba ii}

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:07.300
Note:
The Yamato stayed on Iscandar for 11 days,
and leaves the planet on May 30th.

00:24:02.820 --> 00:24:11.220
In the hearts of men, who are
leaving on a long journey...{Tabidattsu otoko no mune ni wa}

00:24:07.830 --> 00:24:14.430
Translation

00:24:07.830 --> 00:24:14.430
Editing

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:18.820
...a piece of romance is needed.{Roman no kakera ga hoshii no sa}

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:22.000
Timing

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:22.000
Song Translations

00:24:18.820 --> 00:24:22.820
La la la...

00:24:22.000 --> 00:24:30.000
A

00:24:22.820 --> 00:24:26.820
La la la...

00:24:26.820 --> 00:24:36.720
La la la, red scarf.{makka na scarf}
